{"id":"692cae5bf1d556a5","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-hodge-laplacian.md","title":"Hodge Laplacian","display":"df-hodge-laplacian — Hodge Laplacian","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hodge-laplacian","aliases":["58-df-hodge-laplacian","Hodge Laplacian"],"display":"df-hodge-laplacian — Hodge Laplacian","depends_on":["[[58-df-hodge-star]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hodge-laplacian"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hodge-laplacian</span><span>Hodge Laplacian</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hodge-laplacian — Hodge Laplacian"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" href=\"?note=c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" title=\"58-df-hodge-star\">58-df-hodge-star</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,g)\">\\((M,g)\\)</span> (oriented Riemannian <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-manifold)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in n+1\">\\(k\\in n+1\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d,*_g,\\delta,\\Delta\\in V^{n+1}\">\\(d,*_g,\\delta,\\Delta\\in V^{n+1}\\)</span> (families of exterior derivatives, Hodge stars, codifferentials, and Laplacians)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{vol}_g\\in\\Omega^n(M,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{vol}_g\\in\\Omega^n(M,n)\\)</span> (chosen positive volume form)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(k),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(k),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)\\)</span> (oriented Hodge-star predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" href=\"?note=c8c26f9dc2425e2f\" title=\"58-df-hodge-star\">58-df-hodge-star</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\">\\(\\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H^k(M;\\Delta)\">\\(\\mathcal H^k(M;\\Delta)\\)</span> (space of harmonic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-forms defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}codifferential}\\vdash \\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\leftrightarrow d,*_g,\\delta\\in V^{n+1}\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(j),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,j,n)\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{Function}(d(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j+1}(M,n))\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\delta(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j-1}(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^j(M,n)\\;\\left[\\delta(j)(\\omega)=(-1)^{n(j+1)+1}*_g(n-j+1)\\bigl(d(n-j)(*_g(j)(\\omega))\\bigr)\\right]\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}codifferential}\\vdash \\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\leftrightarrow d,*_g,\\delta\\in V^{n+1}\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(j),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,j,n)\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{Function}(d(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j+1}(M,n))\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\delta(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j-1}(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^j(M,n)\\;\\left[\\delta(j)(\\omega)=(-1)^{n(j+1)+1}*_g(n-j+1)\\bigl(d(n-j)(*_g(j)(\\omega))\\bigr)\\right]\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}laplacian}\\vdash \\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\leftrightarrow d,\\delta,\\Delta\\in V^{n+1}\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{Function}(d(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j+1}(M,n))\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\delta(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j-1}(M,n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(0),\\Omega^0(M,n),\\Omega^0(M,n))\\land\\left[n=0\\to\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^0(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(0)(\\omega)=0)\\right]\\land\\left[n\\neq0\\to\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^0(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(0)(\\omega)=\\delta(1)(d(0)(\\omega)))\\right]\\land\\forall k\\in n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(k),\\Omega^k(M,n),\\Omega^k(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^k(M,n)\\;[\\Delta(k)(\\omega)=d(k-1)(\\delta(k)(\\omega))+\\delta(k+1)(d(k)(\\omega))]\\right)\\land\\left(n\\neq0\\to\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(n),\\Omega^n(M,n),\\Omega^n(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^n(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(n)(\\omega)=d(n-1)(\\delta(n)(\\omega)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}laplacian}\\vdash \\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\leftrightarrow d,\\delta,\\Delta\\in V^{n+1}\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;\\mathrm{Function}(d(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j+1}(M,n))\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\delta(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j-1}(M,n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(0),\\Omega^0(M,n),\\Omega^0(M,n))\\land\\left[n=0\\to\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^0(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(0)(\\omega)=0)\\right]\\land\\left[n\\neq0\\to\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^0(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(0)(\\omega)=\\delta(1)(d(0)(\\omega)))\\right]\\land\\forall k\\in n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(k),\\Omega^k(M,n),\\Omega^k(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^k(M,n)\\;[\\Delta(k)(\\omega)=d(k-1)(\\delta(k)(\\omega))+\\delta(k+1)(d(k)(\\omega))]\\right)\\land\\left(n\\neq0\\to\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(n),\\Omega^n(M,n),\\Omega^n(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^n(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(n)(\\omega)=d(n-1)(\\delta(n)(\\omega)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}harmonic}\\vdash \\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\land\\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\land k\\in n+1\\to\\mathcal H^k(M;\\Delta)\\coloneqq\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega^k(M,n):\\Delta(k)(\\omega)=0\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}harmonic}\\vdash \\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\land\\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\land k\\in n+1\\to\\mathcal H^k(M;\\Delta)\\coloneqq\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega^k(M,n):\\Delta(k)(\\omega)=0\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The degree indices make both summands endomorphisms of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega^k(M)\">\\(\\Omega^k(M)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The Laplacian-family predicate itself now types every exterior derivative and codifferential it applies; this typing is not left to a separate use-site antecedent.</li>\n<li>The Weitzenbock identity and Hodge decomposition require geometric hypotheses and are theorem-level statements; the earlier four-term equality did not encode the orthogonality or compactness conditions of Hodge decomposition.</li>\n<li>On an oriented Riemannian manifold, the codifferential can be expressed from the Hodge star with a convention-dependent sign.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Warner, Foundations of Differentiable Manifolds and Lie Groups</li>\n<li>Griffiths and Harris, Principles of Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-hodge-star","status":"resolved","id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hodge-star]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hodge-star","status":"resolved","id":"c8c26f9dc2425e2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(k),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)$ (oriented Hodge-star predicate, see [[58-df-hodge-star]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(M,g)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in n+1","display":false},{"tex":"d,*_g,\\delta,\\Delta\\in V^{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{vol}_g\\in\\Omega^n(M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(k),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,k,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H^k(M;\\Delta)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}codifferential}\\vdash \\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\leftrightarrow d,*_g,\\delta\\in V^{n+1}\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\;\\mathrm{HodgeStar}_S(*_g(j),M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,j,n)\\land\\forall j<n\\;\\mathrm{Function}(d(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j+1}(M,n))\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\delta(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j-1}(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^j(M,n)\\;\\left[\\delta(j)(\\omega)=(-1)^{n(j+1)+1}*_g(n-j+1)\\bigl(d(n-j)(*_g(j)(\\omega))\\bigr)\\right]\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}laplacian}\\vdash \\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\leftrightarrow d,\\delta,\\Delta\\in V^{n+1}\\land\\forall j<n\\;\\mathrm{Function}(d(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j+1}(M,n))\\land\\forall j\\in n+1\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\mathrm{Function}(\\delta(j),\\Omega^j(M,n),\\Omega^{j-1}(M,n))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(0),\\Omega^0(M,n),\\Omega^0(M,n))\\land\\left[n=0\\to\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^0(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(0)(\\omega)=0)\\right]\\land\\left[n\\neq0\\to\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^0(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(0)(\\omega)=\\delta(1)(d(0)(\\omega)))\\right]\\land\\forall k\\in n\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(k),\\Omega^k(M,n),\\Omega^k(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^k(M,n)\\;[\\Delta(k)(\\omega)=d(k-1)(\\delta(k)(\\omega))+\\delta(k+1)(d(k)(\\omega))]\\right)\\land\\left(n\\neq0\\to\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta(n),\\Omega^n(M,n),\\Omega^n(M,n))\\land\\forall\\omega\\in\\Omega^n(M,n)\\;(\\Delta(n)(\\omega)=d(n-1)(\\delta(n)(\\omega)))\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hodge\\text{-}harmonic}\\vdash \\mathrm{CodifferentialFamily}_S(\\delta;d,*_g,M,g,\\mathrm{vol}_g,n)\\land\\mathrm{HodgeLaplacianFamily}_S(\\Delta;d,\\delta,M,n)\\land k\\in n+1\\to\\mathcal H^k(M;\\Delta)\\coloneqq\\{\\omega\\in\\Omega^k(M,n):\\Delta(k)(\\omega)=0\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega^k(M)","display":false}],"bytes":3426,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-625","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-hodge-laplacian.md|58-df-hodge-laplacian]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["c8c26f9dc2425e2f","36d7463d215be751"]}